{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Clam Guy\n🐚 Character returning from Undertale, now on the path by Hometown's Lake (Ch.2). Shares an almost identical design with Clam Girl, a distinct NPC exclusive to Undertale.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Gaster (W. D. Gaster)**\nShares the same disappearance sound as Mystery Man and his Followers, and her gray sprite links her directly to the same \"Goner\" aesthetic of everything related to him.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_gonerclampgirl.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":123,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_Clam_Guy_overworld.png","x":-35,"y":-290,"width":111,"height":189},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Did Gaster know of Susie's existence before Deltarune existed?**\nIf Clam Girl is truly linked to Gaster (through the shared sound and color), her mention of \"Suzy\" would imply that, within the fiction itself, some version of Gaster was already aware of Susie's existence…","x":-640,"y":-125,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nThe fandom's near-unanimous reading is that \"Suzy\" is Deltarune's own Susie — the similarity in names, combined with the fact that this dialogue was added just a month before the Ch.1 announcement, makes it very…","x":-470,"y":-555,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"4a1daccf3a23ed4b","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":-443,"y":-842,"width":163,"height":287},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Onionsan**\n\"The thing\" that Clam Guy alludes to without naming directly, after running into him by the Lake in Ch.1.","x":482,"y":200,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Onionsan_-_Kawaii.webp","x":880,"y":5,"width":173,"height":170},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_and_deltarune_clampgirl_goner_speech.webp","x":-945,"y":-97,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_gonerclampgirl.webp","x":-638,"y":-812,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2_x0","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}